  "nutshell": [
    "- China's May apparent steel consumption fell 12.3%, signal-",
    "- ling persistent slump.   (Page 1)",
    "- Summer slowdown and tariff-driven frontloaded exports",
    "- weaken expected seasonal rebound.   (Page 1)",
    "- China, India pivot to higher-calorific coal, trimming Indone-",
    "- sian seaborne imports. (Page 1)",
    "- Longer-haul Mongolian, South African coal boosts Panamax",
    "- demand; Capesize pressured. (Page 1)",
    "- WTI crude oil futures fell to about USD 65.2 per barrel after",
    "- their sharpest weekly drop in over two years.  (Page 8)"
